tnt-logic-realistic-explosion-physics:
&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 


 Blow out the support and the building comes down. 

You know the sight: you blow up the bottom of a tower and the rest of it just hangs there in the air. This mod fixes that.

After every explosion it looks at what is left, works out what is still standing on something, and lets everything else come down as falling blocks. Take out the base of a tower and the whole thing topples. Blow up a bridge pillar and the middle drops out. Hit a tree at the trunk and it goes down, leaves and all.

The explosion itself stays the same - you get exactly the vanilla crater. Everything the mod does happens after it.

 Side: Client & Server &nbsp;•&nbsp; Works with: Fabric, Forge, NeoForge


