burden-of-time:
&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 
 &nbsp; 
 ABOUT 
 Burden Of Time is a mod that allows your world to age without input from the player. 
 &nbsp; 
 FEATURES 
 Social Trails (Desire Paths) -&nbsp; This adds social trails (desire paths) to your world. Any mob crossing a grassy area will, after a period of time, cause the ground to start eroding. The order in which the ground changes are Grass Block &gt; Dirt &gt; Coarse Dirt &gt; Grass Path 
 &nbsp; 
 Mossing -&nbsp; Over a period of time, certain blocks that have moss variants will begin to grow moss on them. This effect can be sped up in the config or by ramping up the random tick speed of your world. 
 &nbsp; 
 Fluid Erosion -&nbsp; Water and lava will have certain effects on blocks. Flowing water will over time crack certain blocks that have cracked variants and lava, both still and flowing will bake blocks that can be baked 
